Dad!

287
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:36,360
Dad!

288
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,920
Why did you do this?!

289
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:54,720
At first, I wasn't going to mess with you anymore

290
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:58,520
because I saw that you were making Jane happy.

291
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:03,400
But when you made his family suffer,

292
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:06,680
that's when I knew...

293
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:09,840
that a person like you never changes!

294
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:14,080
So I teamed up to take revenge

295
00:30:15,080 --> 00:30:16,640
with the people who held grudges against you

296
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,640
staging that car accident.

297
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:23,040
But the driver didn't know

298
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,960
that Jane was in that car.

299
00:30:31,040 --> 00:30:32,840
You were behind everything this entire time.

300
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:39,560
Yes!

301
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,000
It was all me!

302
00:30:42,560 --> 00:30:44,240
Have you gone completely insane, Dan?!

303
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:46,760
Am I insane?

304
00:30:49,080 --> 00:30:50,040
Yeah, I'm insane!

305
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:54,520
But I had to do something!

306
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:57,040
Because an evil person like you

307
00:30:57,280 --> 00:30:58,880
doesn't deserve to be happy.

308
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:02,320
Okay.

309
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,440
Dan.

310
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:07,360
I'm sorry.

311
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:11,680
I promise I will pay you back for everything,

312
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:13,840
as much as I possibly can.

313
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,320
But my brother has nothing to do with this.

314
00:31:19,800 --> 00:31:20,880
Let my brother go

315
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:23,200
and come clear things with me instead.

316
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:27,360
It's time for you to pay for your wrongdoings.

317
00:31:56,040 --> 00:31:56,680
Hey!

318
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,280
Hey!

319
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:58,080
Hey!

320
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:58,840
Let go!

321
00:31:58,920 --> 00:31:59,480
P'Jane!

322
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,880
Get Jamie out first!

323
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:02,200
Jane!

324
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:03,240
Let go!

325
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:06,560
Ouch!

326
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:09,480
Let go!

327
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:10,600
Jamie, hurry and get out of here,

328
00:32:11,080 --> 00:32:12,160
then go get help!

329
00:32:12,360 --> 00:32:13,160
Hurry!

330
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:14,920
P'Dan, calm down!

331
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:18,160
Don't...

332
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:19,440
Don't come any closer!

333
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:20,880
Okay, alright.

334
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,240
Just calm down.

335
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:28,680
If you want me,

336
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:31,000
you can take me instead!

337
00:32:33,080 --> 00:32:33,600
P'Dan...

338
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:35,680
Please calm down first.

339
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,960
The P'Dan that I know isn't someone like this.

340
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:45,880
You always side with him,

341
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:49,040
no matter how much evil he does!

342
00:32:50,160 --> 00:32:50,680
Argh!

343
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,000
Ow!

344
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:55,520
Jane!

345
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,160
P'Jane!

346
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:23,800
Don't!

347
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,360
Go to hell.

348
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:26,520
Jane.

349
00:33:33,800 --> 00:33:34,600
Don't!

350
00:33:45,120 --> 00:33:45,960
P'Dan, stop.

351
00:33:52,560 --> 00:33:53,800
Are you going to shoot me, Jane?

352
00:33:57,520 --> 00:33:58,800
I know you well.

353
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,840
You wouldn't dare do something like this.

354
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:13,920
Being sensitive is a good thing, you know.

355
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:16,920
I just wanted to see you become a bit stronger.

356
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:18,639
Breathe slowly.

357
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:20,199
Slowly...

358
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:52,199
P'Jane!

359
00:34:53,280 --> 00:34:54,080
P'Jane!

360
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,320
P'Jane, are you okay?

361
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,280
P'Jane!

362
00:35:01,120 --> 00:35:02,400
Don't fall asleep!

363
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,240
Jane.

364
00:35:05,600 --> 00:35:06,400
No..

365
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:09,760
I'm right here.

366
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:53,400
Go home and rest first, Jane.

367
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,680
I'll take care of things here myself.

368
00:35:59,680 --> 00:36:01,640
He ended up like this because of me...

369
00:36:03,160 --> 00:36:04,000
No.

370
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:07,320
He has never blamed you like that at all.

371
00:36:10,240 --> 00:36:11,760
Do you have any idea how much he loves

372
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:12,920
and cares about you?

373
00:36:18,080 --> 00:36:19,160
And he has never done this much

374
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,560
for anyone else before either.

375
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,440
Wake up..

376
00:36:56,160 --> 00:36:57,600
Please, come back to me.

377
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:07,680
You told me when we got back together, right?

378
00:37:11,560 --> 00:37:13,000
That if you lost me,

379
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:16,680
you wouldn't be able to stand it.

380
00:37:22,080 --> 00:37:23,480
It's the same for me...

381
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:32,040
I wouldn't be able to stand it either.

382
00:37:50,040 --> 00:37:51,400
P'Jane, you once said

383
00:37:51,400 --> 00:37:53,400
I could ask for anything, right?

384
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:59,080
I've never done a favor with you willingly,

385
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:06,480
but this time, can I ask to do a favor with you?

386
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,280
Please wake up and come back.

387
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:18,680
I'll give anything for it.

388
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:21,680
I'll give up anything.

389
00:38:38,080 --> 00:38:38,800
P'Jane.

390
00:38:40,520 --> 00:38:42,000
Can you please come back to me?

391
00:39:01,240 --> 00:39:02,080
P'Jane.

392
00:39:04,160 --> 00:39:04,960
P'Jane.

393
00:39:06,200 --> 00:39:08,200
I'm right here.

394
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:18,880
I'm ok.

395
00:39:21,040 --> 00:39:21,920
I'm fine.

396
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:26,000
Do you know

397
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:29,720
how worried I was about you?

398
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:35,960
Your condition has improved a lot.

399
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:38,360
Tomorrow you should be able to go home to recover.

400
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:40,680
Yay!

401
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:43,000
JP is going home with me!

402
00:39:44,240 --> 00:39:45,720
But you can't be a brat.

403
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:47,680
No overworking!

404
00:39:48,080 --> 00:39:49,040
Rest means rest!

405
00:39:49,520 --> 00:39:50,000
Understood?

406
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,360
Yes.

407
00:39:52,160 --> 00:39:53,680
I'll be resting for a long time.

408
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:54,520
Better yet, I don't even have to

409
00:39:54,520 --> 00:39:56,400
go back to the company.

410
00:39:57,320 --> 00:39:58,760
I have a talented secretary

411
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:00,760
to take care of my work.

412
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:05,000
In that case, I'll leave you to take care of it then.

413
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:12,280
Are you going to slack off on work, Mr.CEO?

414
00:40:12,880 --> 00:40:14,800
Everyone at the company is so worried about you.

415
00:40:18,520 --> 00:40:19,920
Are they really worried?

416
00:40:20,720 --> 00:40:22,000
I thought they'd be happy

417
00:40:22,720 --> 00:40:23,880
that Mr.Lilac isn't around.

418
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:27,840
Uh...

419
00:40:29,880 --> 00:40:32,280
Daddy called to ask

420
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:34,480
how you were doing.

421
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:38,200
But once he knew you were getting better,

422
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:39,680
he didn't say anything else.

423
00:40:42,360 --> 00:40:43,240
Never mind him.

424
00:40:44,080 --> 00:40:45,200
He's always been that kind of person.

425
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:48,800
Oh,

426
00:40:49,520 --> 00:40:51,240
about what you planned.

427
00:40:51,800 --> 00:40:53,520
I've taken care of everything.

428
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:03,120
Thank you, Jane.

429
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:07,120
Oh! What's this?

430
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:09,400
JP and Lil' Jane?

431
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:11,080
What is it?

432
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:12,640
Tell me.

433
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,080
No.

434
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:15,560
It's a surprise.

435
00:41:29,200 --> 00:41:30,000
Here.

436
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:34,160
Thanks.

437
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:56,640
Oh?

438
00:41:57,480 --> 00:41:58,160
P'Jane?

439
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,080
You haven't fully recovered yet,

440
00:42:00,080 --> 00:42:01,400
why did you come here?

441
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:02,000
Yeah.

442
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:03,480
Has your condition gotten better already?

443
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:06,400
Mr.Jane.

444
00:42:06,760 --> 00:42:08,800
Why aren't you resting at home.

445
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:12,280
I just happen to have something important

446
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:14,360
that I must talk to you about today.

447
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,280
Um...

448
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:20,000
what important matter do you want

449
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:21,640
to talk to me about?

450
00:42:25,000 --> 00:42:27,080
I have to apologize to both of you once again,

451
00:42:28,640 --> 00:42:30,240
for the trouble I've caused

452
00:42:33,040 --> 00:42:35,000
and for not taking good enough care of Jane.

453
00:42:37,040 --> 00:42:38,000
About that...

454
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:41,880
We've have already talked it over.

455
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:47,080
You saved Jane's life,

456
00:42:47,080 --> 00:42:48,200
even to the point of getting seriously

457
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:49,520
injured like this.

458
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:54,600
Now I truly believe

459
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,080
that you really love our son.

460
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:03,840
And Jane loves you very much too.

461
00:43:04,720 --> 00:43:05,920
We don't want to be...

462
00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:08,640
an obstacle to our child's happiness

463
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:11,480
like we used to be in the past.

464
00:43:12,160 --> 00:43:12,760
Dad...

465
00:43:16,640 --> 00:43:17,600
Thank you.

466
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:29,760
In that case...

467
00:43:35,520 --> 00:43:36,600
Oh. P'Jane...

468
00:43:49,080 --> 00:43:50,280
I am officially asking for Jane's hand

469
00:43:50,280 --> 00:43:52,160
in marriage from both of you.

470
00:43:59,720 --> 00:44:00,400
Dad...

471
00:44:02,720 --> 00:44:03,680
I agree.

472
00:44:04,880 --> 00:44:05,440
What about you?

473
00:44:10,680 --> 00:44:12,000
I agree too.

474
00:44:16,680 --> 00:44:17,600
My, my.

475
00:44:17,760 --> 00:44:20,320
usually people ask for P'Jane,

476
00:44:21,120 --> 00:44:22,440
You're so grand, huh,

477
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:24,520
that he's here to ask you instead!

478
00:44:27,000 --> 00:44:27,680
So...

479
00:44:28,080 --> 00:44:31,280
that means P'Jane is now my brother-in-law.

480
00:44:32,240 --> 00:44:33,840
What should I ask for?

481
00:44:34,120 --> 00:44:34,840
Wow.

482
00:44:35,040 --> 00:44:35,640
Stop right there.

483
00:44:35,760 --> 00:44:36,440
Ooh!

484
00:44:38,560 --> 00:44:40,000
Don't ask P'Jane.

485
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:41,800
Why?

486
00:44:44,920 --> 00:44:46,280
Because only I get to ask him.

487
00:44:46,880 --> 00:44:48,560
My, my!

488
00:44:48,560 --> 00:44:50,000
Oh wow!

489
00:44:50,800 --> 00:44:53,000
Whoa!

490
00:44:56,080 --> 00:44:56,560
Hey!

491
00:44:57,200 --> 00:44:58,440
Are you two dating now?

492
00:44:58,520 --> 00:44:59,040
Well...

493
00:44:59,240 --> 00:45:00,320
something like that.

494
00:45:01,080 --> 00:45:03,000
Something like that?

495
00:45:03,120 --> 00:45:04,280
Damn...

496
00:45:04,280 --> 00:45:05,560
We're already dating,

497
00:45:05,600 --> 00:45:08,240
why put up an act? Just tell your friends!

498
00:45:08,720 --> 00:45:09,200
Gap...

499
00:45:10,160 --> 00:45:11,480
She's embarrassed! Still embarrassed!

500
00:45:11,480 --> 00:45:12,080
Yeah,

501
00:45:12,280 --> 00:45:13,720
Playing hard to get, Cherry!

502
00:45:14,240 --> 00:45:16,080
Gap's been chasing you for seven years now!

503
00:45:16,800 --> 00:45:17,280
Damn it,

504
00:45:17,640 --> 00:45:18,800
am I the only single one left?

505
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:21,360
Oh wow!

506
00:45:21,360 --> 00:45:22,520
Aw, Khing...

507
00:45:23,120 --> 00:45:25,160
We aren't going anywhere.

508
00:45:25,480 --> 00:45:25,960
Yeah.

509
00:45:26,240 --> 00:45:27,400
Gap and Cherry will probably break up soon anyway.

510
00:45:27,400 --> 00:45:27,880
Hey!

511
00:45:28,200 --> 00:45:29,800
Jane, you bastard!

512
00:45:31,200 --> 00:45:32,640
Look at you guys.

513
00:45:32,880 --> 00:45:33,400
Why?

514
00:45:33,400 --> 00:45:34,640
Was it that smooth?

515
00:45:34,640 --> 00:45:36,080
It took forever for you two.

516
00:45:36,440 --> 00:45:38,760
Oh.

517
00:45:41,520 --> 00:45:42,080
Sorry.

518
00:45:42,840 --> 00:45:43,480
It's okay.

519
00:45:43,800 --> 00:45:44,680
No need to be tense.

520
00:45:48,480 --> 00:45:49,560
Out of everyone at this table,

521
00:45:49,800 --> 00:45:51,000
you look the most tense.

522
00:45:54,120 --> 00:45:54,640
True.

523
00:45:55,120 --> 00:45:55,880
Yeah.

524
00:46:03,640 --> 00:46:04,600
I have something to give you guys.

525
00:46:04,600 --> 00:46:05,920
Huh? Here,

526
00:46:06,800 --> 00:46:07,680
take it.

527
00:46:07,680 --> 00:46:09,480
Here. You and Cherry.

528
00:46:09,480 --> 00:46:10,200
Hey. Here.

529
00:46:10,200 --> 00:46:11,400
Mm. Is this for a charity donation?

530
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:13,560
Don't forget to put money in the envelope for us! Hey!

531
00:46:13,560 --> 00:46:14,080
Damn!

532
00:46:14,160 --> 00:46:14,800
(Jennalee)

533
00:46:14,800 --> 00:46:15,480
(You are invited to the wedding )

534
00:46:15,480 --> 00:46:16,280
(of Jane Patrick and Jennalee) Holy shit!

535
00:46:16,280 --> 00:46:17,240
It's here!

536
00:46:18,240 --> 00:46:19,320
Is it cute?

537
00:46:19,320 --> 00:46:21,080
So cute! I designed it myself, you know!

538
00:46:21,080 --> 00:46:22,440
Big Jane and Small Jane too!

539
00:46:23,080 --> 00:46:23,880
So cute!

540
00:46:24,640 --> 00:46:26,280
You're finally getting married!

541
00:46:27,720 --> 00:46:29,240
I was rooting for you both,

542
00:46:29,240 --> 00:46:30,360
there were so many obstacles!

543
00:46:30,880 --> 00:46:32,360
Well, we're getting married now!

544
00:46:33,600 --> 00:46:34,760
Hey, Gap,

545
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:37,280
come be the MC for me.

546
00:46:37,920 --> 00:46:41,000
Your wedding is being held at the CEO's house, right?

547
00:46:41,240 --> 00:46:41,720
Correct.

548
00:46:42,920 --> 00:46:43,440
Damn it!

549
00:46:43,680 --> 00:46:46,200
So if I swear and say curse words

550
00:46:46,440 --> 00:46:47,920
will I get fired or what?

551
00:46:49,320 --> 00:46:50,200
Probably, yeah.

552
00:46:51,080 --> 00:46:53,960
No way, I don't want to get fired!

553
00:46:54,760 --> 00:46:55,480
Don't want to get fired...

554
00:46:55,480 --> 00:46:56,680
I won't fire you, Gap.

555
00:46:57,920 --> 00:46:58,600
Really?

556
00:46:59,040 --> 00:47:00,120
Come on, cheers!

557
00:47:00,320 --> 00:47:01,160
Cheers!

558
00:47:01,360 --> 00:47:01,960
Cheers!

559
00:47:01,960 --> 00:47:02,520
Cheers!

560
00:47:09,280 --> 00:47:10,800
I have one more thing to tell everyone.

561
00:47:11,400 --> 00:47:12,320
Huh! Huh?

562
00:47:12,680 --> 00:47:13,240
What is it?

563
00:47:14,160 --> 00:47:14,640
Here.

564
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:20,240
Hey! Is this your webtoon?

565
00:47:20,680 --> 00:47:22,080
My new webtoon.

566
00:47:22,680 --> 00:47:24,000
I'm planning to launch it after the wedding.

567
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:26,840
Hey! Holy shit!

568
00:47:27,200 --> 00:47:28,400
So you've been writing about

569
00:47:28,400 --> 00:47:30,320
your own story this whole time?

570
00:47:30,320 --> 00:47:31,840
Honestly though, if you think about it,

571
00:47:32,320 --> 00:47:33,200
your own story

572
00:47:33,920 --> 00:47:35,880
is way spicier than a lot of BL series

573
00:47:35,880 --> 00:47:37,200
out there, man!

574
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:38,040
Oh wow,

575
00:47:38,040 --> 00:47:39,400
it's practically a vertical short drama

576
00:47:39,400 --> 00:47:40,560
at this point, your story!

577
00:47:40,840 --> 00:47:41,360
For real!

578
00:47:42,040 --> 00:47:43,360
People will definitely love this kind of stuff!

579
00:47:43,680 --> 00:47:44,920
It's gonna be a hit for sure! For real!

580
00:47:45,400 --> 00:47:46,400
Really? Yeah!

